,"merged_at":"2026-08-12T17:20:26Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`get_minimum_size()` is a public method of `Control`, that's exposed, but in some GUI Nodes the override is incorrectly put in the `protected` section, preventing calling `node->get_minimum_size()` (note that a workaround is `node->call(\"get_minimum_size\")`, which works). This PR makes them `public`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIncludes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122293, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122292, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122290","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122294/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122294/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}